// Invariants about lists.
//
// The Checks in checks/ are the only tests in the project. The simulator
// evaluates them on the server's data after every step of every simulated run,
// and on each browser's copy once sync settles.
//
// Two more checks are always on and never written here:
//   - every simulated run must match some one-machine run of the same
//     commands (the oracle);
//   - once sync settles, every browser's query results equal the server's.

names_not_blank = Check(|| lists.all(|l| not l.name.trim().is_empty()))
